    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15975" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ĕpĭphŏra</span></b> ,
			ae, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιφορά</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>An afflux;</i> as a disease, <i>a
				defluxion of humors</i>, <i><span class="en">Col. 6, 17,
				8</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 20, 9, 40, § 103</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">29, 6, 38,
				§ 118 al.</span></i> (in <i><span class="en">Cic. Fam.
				16, 23</span></i>, written as Greek).—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> As a rhet. fig., <i>a
				repetition</i>, <i><span class="en">Rufin. de Fig. 1, 8, p.
				30</span></i>.</div>
